EN:
I thought maybe if I flexed really
hard, I could crush this cold!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
But I guess I'll take some {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}medicine{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.

DE:
Ich dachte, ich werde die Erkältung
los, wenn ich im Training heißlaufe!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Aber ich brauch wohl doch {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Medizin{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}...

TRANSLATION:
Kaslarımı yeterince sıkarsam bu soğuk
 algınlığını ezebilirim sanmıştım{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
! Ama galiba biraz ilaç {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}içeceğim{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.
